#: includes/Scan.php:145
#, php-format
msgid ""
"For each service behind these entries, give me these three lines. Group entries that belong to the same service.\n"
"Provider: the company's name and postal address\n"
"Purpose: one short sentence a visitor understands\n"
"Privacy policy: the address of the provider's privacy policy\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"Google Tag Manager\n"
"Provider: Google Ireland Limited, Gordon House, Barrow Street, Dublin 4, Ireland\n"
"Purpose: Loads the tags configured in this site's Google Tag Manager container.\n"
"Privacy policy: https://business.safety.google/privacy/\n"
"\n"
"If you cannot tell what an entry is, say so instead of guessing. Write the purpose in the language %s."
